OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for false imprisonment
OL,4,Aafter kidnap
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of men who kidnapped a man from
OL,7,Fhis home in the middle of the night and
OL,8,Fforced him into a car have been jailed.
OL,10,FMuhammed Kah, Zafar Dormant and Nathan
OL,11,FVilarinho were arrested after a man was
OL,12,Fseen being dragged into a vehicle in
OL,13,FSneinton Boulevard, in Sneinton, in the
OL,14,Fearly hours of 26 May, Nottinghamshire
OL,15,FPolice said.
OL,17,FAll three men, from London, pleaded
OL,18,Fguilty to kidnap and false imprisonment
OL,19,Fand were sentenced at Nottingham Crown
OL,20,FCourt on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
