OL,3,GNEWSAMen jailed for false imprisonment
OL,4,Aafter kidnap
OL,5,
OL,6,FDormant, 25, of Bishopsgate, was jailed
OL,7,Ffor 40 months, Kah, 25, of Adelina
OL,8,FGrove, Tower Hamlets, was jailed for 32
OL,9,Fmonths and Vilarinho, 23, of Warton
OL,10,FRoad, Stratford, was sentenced to three
OL,11,Fyears in jail.
